WEBVTT

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.700
Dad.

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.800
Daddy!

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:45.010
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:49.450
...and lead them to ruin.

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:55.460
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:59.860
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:03.000
...in the human world.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.870
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:13.510
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:19.210
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:23.320
No one knows her true face.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.360
JAPANESE EXAM

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.290
Okay. Time is up.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:34.150
I couldn't answer right at all!
Miyu, how about you?

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:37.020
What? Oh, well.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.220
What do you mean, "Oh, well"?

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:43.740
I envy you because you get good
grades without studying too hard.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.840
Miyu, when do you study?

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:47.530
Let's see...

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:52.540
Never mind. Let's forget it.
The exam is already in the past.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.310
Let's go grab a bite!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.880
Yeah, let's do that!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.180
So, what should we eat?

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:05.790
- How about okonomiyaki?
- That sounds good!

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.930
Miyu, what's wrong?

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:18.500
That girl.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.940
- You mean her?
- What about her?

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:26.580
- She had a small house fire last week.
- Isn't she in Class A?

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.980
Hey, Miyu!

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:34.950
Sorry, I want to talk to her
a little bit. See you.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:40.690
- I wonder what she's thinking.
- Sometimes Miyu acts pretty weird.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.420
- She shouldn't be doing that.
- What?

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:45.630
Hello.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.580
Do I know you?

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:50.470
So you had a fire at home?

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:55.440
A small one in the greenhouse.
The main house was fine.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:58.740
Why are you talking
to someone like me?

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:02.640
I thought you had
an interesting friend.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:08.780
It might be an escaped butterfly from
our greenhouse. It's not my friend.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.150
My father...

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:17.290
- Would you like to come to my house?
- What?

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:25.760
It's just me and my father at home.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:29.500
My father was hurt
slightly in that fire.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:33.200
Oh, my father is a paleontologist.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:37.190
He used to teach at a university
until he fell ill.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:42.450
Now he stays home and I...

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.920
This is our house.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.900
Please come on in.

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:00.710
This way.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:18.950
This way, please.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.130
Do you mind meeting my father
for a second?

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.860
- What?
- I'm sorry.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:39.510
You're not even my friend
and I pushed you to come home with me.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.470
We are already friends.

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:46.160
What? Friends?

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:51.430
Oh, I'm Ruri Sone. And...

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:55.320
I'm Miyu Yamano.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.180
Daddy.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:23.790
I brought a friend. This is my first
time bringing a friend from school.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.690
This is Miyu Yamano.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:28.250
Is that so?

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:33.420
You made a friend, Ruri.
Thank you.

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:39.470
See? So don't worry about me.
I want you to cheer up.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:44.820
It's not good to be cooped up in the
house all the time. I'm doing fine.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:48.280
So it's your turn
to open up your heart.

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:04.560
He's always like that during the day.
He doesn't respond to what I say.

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:08.900
Then he locks himself up
in this greenhouse at night.

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:18.440
Miyu, thank you for meeting my father.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:21.720
You're welcome.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.960
You felt it too, didn't you, Miyu?

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:30.520
The smell of a Shinma.
But it was only the smell.

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:34.460
That place was strange.
The air in the greenhouse...

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:38.830
...was like that of the Jura era,
stagnant like starch.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:42.060
Shiina, you are so very knowledgeable.

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:59.690
Moru? Moru? Where are you?

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:04.590
I wonder where she is.
You are still here, aren't you?

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:09.860
Please come out!
I was out of my mind.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:14.140
I'll never do anything bad.
Please come out!

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:24.780
Moru.

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:34.690
Why did you do such a thing?
Do you not like me?

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:37.620
No, it's not that! I became scared.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:42.630
The time with you was becoming
too sweet, but I finally realized...

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:47.600
...that I am my real self
when I am with you.

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:51.100
Please do not think
you don't like me again.

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:55.000
Never! I'll be useless without you!

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:59.010
Tell me honestly what you think of me.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:03.740
I love you, Moru. You are my love.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.270
Good morning.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.440
Good morning.

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:41.720
- I'm very happy.
- Really?

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:45.720
It's better not to be
too friendly with Ruri Sone.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.790
- Good morning, Yukari.
- How come? How come?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:53.560
- That's not a very nice thing to say.
- I'm saying that for Miyu's sake.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:58.030
That girl was in an institution
until six months ago.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.240
An institution?

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:05.780
I don't know the details, but she did
something horrible as a child.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.570
Something?

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:11.480
The rumor is, she pushed
her mother down the stairs.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.280
- What?
- It's just a rumor, right?

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.980
But when she transferred to Class A...

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:21.220
...she snapped suddenly
and hurt a teacher. Everybody knows.

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:25.130
In Class A, no one approaches her.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:31.130
She doesn't look like it.
What are you going to do, Miyu?

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:37.370
I don't remember. I was only 5.

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:41.170
My father hasn't told me
what really happened.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:44.480
- Then it didn't happen.
- What?

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:48.640
What you don't remember is
something that didn't happen.

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:52.520
It's a matter of whether
it's in your memory or not.

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:55.760
But it exists in my father's memory.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:12:00.370
Why does your father go
to the greenhouse every night?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.200
That's because...

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:07.640
It was after I returned last year...

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:10.540
...from that place.

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:16.510
My father received a guest
from abroad.

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:20.210
Someone sent him with an insect cage.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:25.650
At first, my father said he would
throw away such an ugly butterfly.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:31.090
But he freed it in the greenhouse
on the spur of the moment.

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:36.860
Then the butterfly came to life
so beautifully.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:47.970
Ever since then, my father seems to
be serving that butterfly emotionally.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.760
You have not been eating lunch.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:06.360
I fix your lunch every morning.

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:11.770
I found your lunch
neatly wrapped and thrown away.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.770
I'm sorry.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:19.350
Daddy, you haven't forgiven me,
have you?

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:25.490
I was very happy to return home...

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:28.350
...where you are.

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:02.150
Moru? Moru?

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.730
Wait! I don't have that much energy.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:26.110
Oh, this miracle...

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:13.950
This is the place that I have
dreamed of for a long time.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:17.460
I wonder if you could
live here forever.

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:23.040
It's my dream exactly.
But now it doesn't have to be here.

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:26.330
Moru, as long as
I'm with you, I'm happy.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:32.810
When I'm not with you,
the world is meaningless and empty.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:36.210
It feels like my body
and soul would melt!

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.850
Melt away, using my body.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:43.850
Moru! Oh, my Moru!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:04.270
Don't! Stop it!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:10.760
Who is it? Don't interrupt me!

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:17.690
- Wake up from your dream, Mr. Sone.
- Why do you say such a thing?

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.660
You are in a crack
of your distorted mind.

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:23.520
This is not where
you should remain.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:27.940
What's wrong with it?
It's fine with me. This is my world.

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:33.630
It is the world just for me and Moru!
I don't care where I am.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.920
Moru!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:43.940
Don't go! Please don't abandon me!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:50.550
Moru!

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:06.400
- There is no such thing as Moru.
- What are you saying?

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:10.820
The butterfly fairy never existed
from the beginning.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:12.840
What existed was...

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:23.320
What does this mean?
What is this?

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:33.700
What is this?

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:38.670
I thought you were my friend.
What are you doing with my father?

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.100
Ruri.

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:43.610
My father loves only me.

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:48.940
Only I can love my father
and only I can give my father dreams!

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:52.680
That woman wasn't qualified
to love my father!

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:56.120
That's why I pushed...

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:59.550
I pushed her back!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:03.460
Ruri, you are being manipulated
by a Shinma.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:08.300
The more you love him, the more
the Shinma takes advantage of it.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:13.440
What are you talking about?
I don't understand!

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:17.580
Because I don't remember!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.250
Moru.

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:29.650
Moru, you've come back!

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:33.150
What did I do to my father?

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:38.700
Moru, hold me.
Caress me in your bosom!

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.390
Daddy.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:05.520
Since you were little, you wanted to
be the only one to love your father.

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:11.200
That feeling became so strong you felt
even your mother was in your way.

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:16.260
- It's a lie.
- Moru.

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.530
No!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.800
Moru.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.380
You are the Shinma
causing this mischief.

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:39.450
MAJl-KAN

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.000
Larva!

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:53.800
Stop it! Don't torment Moru!

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:56.740
Miyu, this Shinma doesn't have form.

00:19:57.150 --> 00:20:01.490
Right, because it can only live
in the cracks of a human mind.

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:08.920
Cry. Scream.
Your territory will vanish.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.720
Miyu.

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:22.630
Into the darkness, Shinma!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.440
Miyu.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:46.720
Moru, don't leave me behind!

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:49.670
Moru!

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:56.840
It was what he wanted, Miyu.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:23.990
This girl has sealed off her soul.

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:26.500
Larva, please leave.

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.440
Miyu.

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:32.000
Please go.

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:41.550
Ruri.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:51.680
You don't have
to feel lonely anymore.

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:19.180
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:19.390 --> 00:22:21.720
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:25.860
...from so far away?

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:28.690
Someone smooths down my hair

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:32.960
Who are you?

00:22:35.640 --> 00:22:39.630
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:44.470
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:48.940
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:53.420
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:57.610
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:02.100
Washed away

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:08.890
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:09.100 --> 00:23:13.330
Invited by the moon

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:17.270
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:26.440
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:33.620
The sky cries for me

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:46.830
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:49.370
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:53.510
...from so far away?

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:56.340
Someone smooths down my hair

00:23:56.550 --> 00:24:00.610
Who are you?

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:07.280
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:12.130
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:12.330 --> 00:24:16.600
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:16.800 --> 00:24:21.070
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:21.280 --> 00:24:25.280
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:25.480 --> 00:24:29.750
Washed away

00:24:32.450 --> 00:24:36.550
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:36.760 --> 00:24:40.990
Invited by the moon

00:24:41.200 --> 00:24:44.940
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:47.570 --> 00:24:54.100
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:54.340 --> 00:25:01.270
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.050 --> 00:25:10.460
The village we stumbled into was
targeted by three Shinma brothers.

00:25:10.660 --> 00:25:14.250
In this mysterious place,
I remembered...

00:25:14.460 --> 00:25:19.360
...about the Shinma Protectors,
a clan who watched over the Guardians.

00:25:19.570 --> 00:25:23.760
Was this why I was called here?

00:25:24.010 --> 00:25:28.180
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu,
"Flag of Shinma."

00:25:28.740 --> 00:25:32.440
Memories come back to life.
